sequenceDiagram
    title UC1 — Driving Licence Verification — Full Flow
    participant RNP as Employer HR (Requesting NP)
    participant GW as Beckn Gateway
    participant PNP as DL Verifier (Provider NP)

    Note over RNP,PNP: Discovery
    RNP->>GW: discover<br/>verificationType = DRIVING_LICENCE
    GW->>PNP: discover
    PNP-->>GW: on_discover<br/>resources[DL Verification]<br/>offers[₹50/req, PT30M SLA]
    GW-->>RNP: on_discover

    Note over RNP,PNP: Selection
    RNP->>GW: select (commitment → Resource + Offer)
    GW->>PNP: select
    PNP-->>GW: on_select (consideration: ₹50)
    GW-->>RNP: on_select

    Note over RNP,PNP: Initialisation
    RNP->>GW: init<br/>subject: Ravi Kumar<br/>licence: UP0520240001234<br/>consent: OTP<br/>purpose: EMPLOYMENT_ONBOARDING
    GW->>PNP: init
    PNP-->>GW: on_init (contract initialised)
    GW-->>RNP: on_init

    Note over RNP,PNP: Confirmation
    RNP->>GW: confirm (contract ACTIVE)
    GW->>PNP: confirm
    PNP-->>GW: on_confirm (performance PENDING)
    GW-->>RNP: on_confirm

    Note over RNP,PNP: Result
    Note right of PNP: Queries Parivahan Sewa<br/>Extracts: holder, classes,<br/>expiry, issuing RTO
    RNP->>GW: status
    GW->>PNP: status
    PNP-->>GW: on_status<br/>VERIFIED<br/>holderName, vehicleClasses,<br/>expiryDate, issuingAuthority
    GW-->>RNP: on_status
